    "question": {
      ":question/id": "49d80178-2bb7-5136-8104-5b0906e47c96",
      ":question/problem": "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/generate/scratch/17592186175922/plots/7d3ff7d2b8b20980b9436b9c55b860c5a19cb0ce9d82950a56511da8e6d92b85.png)\n\nIn the diagram above, the equation of the line ${l}_{1}$ is $y=-4x$ and ${l}_{2}$ is perpendicular to ${l}_{1}.$ What is the equation of the line ${l}_{2}?$",
      ":question/answer-fields": [
        {
          ":answer-field/id": "b9e7e065-3aeb-5183-9aed-e4353df330d3",
